{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X 在 S11、S13 等段的感受提示仍然偏密集，即使分时出现，边听音乐边追读也容易分散注意力；Y 的双栏布局更方便快速扫完整体。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 用重点字加亮，让普通观众更容易抓住每段叙事的关键转折，分时出现的感受也能与音乐进程建立对应，不必同时面对一大堆情绪词。它对人物从怀念、动摇、孤独到逐渐接受矛盾并决定继续生活的过程交代得更连贯，音乐感受也更具体，有身体反应、声音质地和情绪变化的层次。Y 的双栏形式确实更容易一眼浏览，但部分感受词并列堆积，与人物叙事和具体音乐时刻的联系不够紧密。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4cdc3455-a21e-4240-91b5-e881e1e74ab3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T154912942121Z", "elapsed_seconds": 96.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T15:50:49.570123+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "37457c2eda29675173b19f4f91b65a47fc738a69982f308ac6cab6e236b4bb81", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatg